{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこと浪漫の感想"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりいろいろ反省..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだダメだな私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃべってるとき、半目だし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口角上がってないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後で見て後悔することが多い..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔の練習...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やきいもは料理じゃないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というツッコミが多数...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←あかん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子作りは何が得意なの？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラウニーとかクッキーとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃおいしいわけでないが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に作ったことあるんだぜ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あああアメイジング！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャンプで他のチームが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作った料理は食べたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恵んでいただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもおいしかった; ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤チームの料理がある机には人が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集まってきませんでした笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華は、今までファンから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もらった言葉のなかでどれが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番印象にのこってるの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからいただいた言葉は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって全部大切です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルになって気づいたこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがいなかったらきっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな風に続いてない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で直接いただくことば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでの声援、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメント、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全て感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、いつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車では、座ってると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐ寝ちゃう？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝れちゃうわよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さつまいもには何かつけたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しなかったのかな？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手作り(←これ重要)のバター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を塗っておいしく食べたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真写りをよくするためになんか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"工夫してることとかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鏡の前で練習してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の乃木坂個別は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかからスタートってのどう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う、うれしいっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドーナツは何味食べたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫の撮影で食べた棒状ドーナツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有名みたいですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はきなこ味を"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさんがみゅうみゅうさんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女だと書いてあったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当ですかっ!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ば れ た か 。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼男前なのよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットのまりかが素なん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...て、あんな野太い声を出すなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当のまりかじゃない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか思ってるわけないでしょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素はまさにあれだと思ってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イメージがくずれてしまった方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな人に「表情筋...笑笑」とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ちょ、顔！笑」と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツッコまれるのが当たり前の私"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんまい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメのお菓子は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅干し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんぶ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫の撮影、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3回目でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出たいと思ってたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影できて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5056510/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の明るい外での撮影。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炎天下で、最強に鬼暑かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中スタッフさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっといちばん大変だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鬼！暑かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"机にひじつこうとしたらね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragra